ASSESSMENT OF HEAVY METALS CONTENT IN SOME MEDICINAL
PLANTS AND SPICES COMMONLY USED IN ROMANIA

ELISABETA MARINESCU 1, ALINA MIHAELA ELISEI 1, ANA CLARA APROTOSOAIE 2*,
OANA CIOANCĂ 2, ADRIANA TRIFAN 2, ANCA MIRON 2, SILVIA ROBU 1, CAMELIA IFRIM 4,
MONICA HĂNCIANU 2
1
  “Dunărea de Jos” University, Faculty of Medicine and Pharmacy, 35 Al. I. Cuza Street, Galați, Romania
2
  “Grigore T. Popa” University of Medicine and Pharmacy, Faculty of Farmacy, 16 Universității Street, Iaşi, Romania
3
