+
+## Verification notes
+
+The PDF title, byline, DOI, year, journal, sample descriptions, methods, and Tables III-IV values were read from the auto-fetched PDF. The paper reports element names without arsenic or mercury speciation, so arsenic and mercury are treated as total-element occurrence evidence. Packaged and wild-growing samples are source-distinct and should not be pooled without a logged basis decision.
