+## Verification notes
+
+The PDF title, byline, DOI, journal, year, methods, and Table 4 values were read from the auto-fetched PDF. The paper reports total elemental concentrations and does not provide arsenic, mercury, or chromium speciation. Values reported as 0.00 mg/kg are retained as source-reported table entries rather than interpreted as analytical zeroes.

